<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT CHILE 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT CHILE 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat Chile 4-0 (halftime 2-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Ronaldo (8th minute, 58, penalty), Romario (40 and 61)</p>
